From c4acc617167c2316b657b8ee0b71ef2823f8a87e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manuel Kuklinski <mk@asdfghasdfgh.de>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:13:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] ath79: add Zyxel NWA5123-AC support

Add device definition and factory image support for the Zyxel
NWA5123-AC enterprise access point.

- Add Build/zyxel-deadbeaf recipe using mkdeadbeaf to create
  factory images in Zyxel's proprietary "deadbeaf" format,
  flashable via the stock web UI
- Add NWA5123-AC device definition with LOADER_FLASH_BASE=0x1e000000
  (CS1) and LOADER_FLASH_OFFS=0x180000
- Include mkdeadbeaf.c source (to be submitted to firmware-utils repo)
- Include generated patch files for reference

Note: mkdeadbeaf.c needs to be submitted separately to the
openwrt/firmware-utils repository with a CMakeLists.txt entry:
  FW_UTIL(mkdeadbeaf src/md5.c "" "")

---
